# CMake-regenerated build files under each project's armgcc/ folder.
# These embed machine-specific absolute paths and get freshly
# regenerated by `cmake` on any machine, so don't track them.
# CMakeLists.txt itself is hand-maintained and IS tracked.
**/armgcc/CMakeCache.txt
**/armgcc/CMakeFiles/
**/armgcc/cmake_install.cmake
**/armgcc/Makefile
**/armgcc/debug/

# Top-level Eclipse/MCUXpresso project metadata auto-created when this
# folder gets opened/indexed by the IDE. Not real project content.
/.project
